# Line-ending policy: LF everywhere, on every platform.
#
# WHY THIS FILE EXISTS
#   dist filenames carry a content hash and CI rebuilds dist and diffs it
#   against the committed copy. If a Windows checkout hands the build CRLF
#   sources while CI's Linux checkout hands it LF, the hashes differ and the
#   gate fails on every push made from Windows. build.mjs also normalizes
#   before hashing (belt and braces), but the working tree itself should
#   simply never be CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries — never subject to text conversion.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
